                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Before your first attempt, go into properties and swap your preferred version to original_jelopy.  I ran into a softlock in the tutorial (trying to use the jack would open the car door instead), and had to start over.  Swapping to original_jelopy worked to fix that.\r\n\r\nBut it did reset my progress in the tutorial, so I had to redo that.  Also, every time you select 'save and quit', it takes you back to the select-your-language screen, before letting you into the main menu, which will finally allow you to quit the game.\r\n\r\nFor some reason, left click is both interact, pick up, and use whatever item is in your hand, right click is zoom, and in order to drop an item you have to click (not scroll) the scrollwheel.  Trying to change the keybinds does nothing.\r\n\r\nIf that is the gaming experience you are looking for, look no further.",
